        "text": "DNS Subdomains Tools\nThere are a lot of tools out there that scan for subdomains. What matters is to\nunderstand what they do, so you need to make sure that your chosen one will\ndo the following:\n1.I Quickly brute-force subdomains based on a good quality dictionary file.\n2.I Check for DNS transfer.\n3.I Automate a subdomain lookup on internet search engines like Google.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Fierce\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
